{"4514140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CHEW YOUR FOOD", "steam_appid": 4514140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It didn't chew you properly. Escape its stomach.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/9f1c5256032c64be482781feed04334c.poster.avif?t=1786604311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/9f1c5256032c64be482781feed04334c.webm?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/9f1c5256032c64be482781feed04334c.mp4?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHEW YOUR FOOD is a survival horror game about escaping a monster's maze-like stomach after it ate you mostly whole. Micro-manage your resources whilst solving puzzles and avoiding getting chased by something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You no longer have legs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/772902ff94bfc595b314204b0df8c7c8.poster.avif?t=1786604311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/772902ff94bfc595b314204b0df8c7c8.webm?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/772902ff94bfc595b314204b0df8c7c8.mp4?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to constantly re-secure your bandages because you bleed out. But be careful, timing when to tighten your tourniquet is crucial. Make sure nothing is chasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something's lurking inside the bowels. Trust your ears to avoid what awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slowly digest the mysteries of the stomach.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is hunting me down? How long have they been here? How many are there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/b4282da443cb493274b81420419a4c86.poster.avif?t=1786604311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/b4282da443cb493274b81420419a4c86.webm?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/b4282da443cb493274b81420419a4c86.mp4?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHEW YOUR FOOD is a short game that can be completed in under an hour. It features hand-drawn art &amp; frame-by-frame animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you crawl your way out of the stomach, or will you become someone's meal again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It didn't chew you properly. Escape its stomach.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/9f1c5256032c64be482781feed04334c.poster.avif?t=1786604311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514140/extras/9f1c5256032c64be482781feed04334c.webm?t=1786604311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 